  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Kick Stem-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Drum Stem L-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Drum Stem R-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Bass Stem-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Cook Stem-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Amby Stem-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Stu Stem L-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Stu Stem R-240912 2152**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-09-12.STEMS** (recommended): soundboard; 19 songs; 2453 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-09-12.bandcampbootlegger**: soundboard; 16 songs; 119 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Pacific Coliseum staff hosted the recording crew at the venue [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-09-12.STEMS**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: Soundboard [1]\n- **kglw2024-09-12.bandcampbootlegger**: taped by Sam Joseph; source: SBD [2]. Also: Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, and Grace King Gizzard recorded the show [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @swaycout: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Pacific Coliseum Vancouver BC Sept 12 2024 Poster](https://swaycout.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-pacific-coliseum-vancouver-bc-sept-12-2024-poster/) [5]\n- Poster by Jason Galea Soundcheck: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2024-09-12 Pacific Coliseum, Vancouver, BC, Canada](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-september-12-2024-pacific-coliseum-vancouver-bc-canada.html) [6]",
